== Walkthrough ==

''(This is a subset of the [[Staff of Temperate Flux Quest]])''

Romar Sunto may be found at +385, +90, +19, a few doors down from Gardern.  The room he is in looks like a library and has two places to drop down to the next floor, one with a staircase.  Romar is in the far corner after you walk down.

You say, 'Hail, Romar Sunto'

: Romar Sunto says 'I am Romar Sunto, servant of Solusek Ro.  I am searching for the [coin] of the mighty enchanter [Tash] - if you are interested in helping me acquire it, I will [reward] you with a powerful spell.  I am also a dispenser of the Staff of Ro, sometimes also called [darkwood staves].'

You say, 'What darkwood staves?'

: Romar Sunto says 'Bring me a [[Lambent Stone]] from a hill giant, a sand giant or a griffin and I will give you a [[Darkwood Staff]].'

Bring him the Lambent Stone and you receive a Darkwood Staff.

: Romar Sunto says 'A stone for a staff - very well.'

<div class="facblock">
* Your faction standing with [[Temple Of Sol Ro|Temple of Sol Ro]] got better.
* Your faction standing with [[Shadowed Men]] got worse.
</div>
